      <h1>Regional Gateways</h1>
      <p class="dp-cover-desc">
        The Regional Gateways tab is the administrator's control surface for the external
        settlement rails that bridge bearerCORE to the wider financial system — the
        <strong>PAPSS</strong> regional clearing rail and the national <strong>RTGS</strong>
        reserve interface. It configures the ISO 20022 endpoints, monitors live rail
        connectivity, surfaces diagnostic error codes, and keeps an immutable handshake
        audit trail. Access is restricted to System Administrators and (read-only)
        Forensic Auditors.
      </p>
      <div class="dp-cover-meta">
        <div>Version <b>1.0</b></div>
        <div>Scope <b>PAPSS · National RTGS · DLT</b></div>
        <div>Updated <b>June 2026</b></div>
        <div>Status <b>Production Reference</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
